  "bodyHash": "vW8jxu68VmE=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sexktZc.png\" alt=\"標題\" width=\"750\" height=\"90\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#800000\">支援版本:&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#000\">1.14.x, 1.15.x, 1.16.x, (1.17.x), 1.18.x, 1.19.x, 1.20.x</span></span></strong><br><br></p><p>一款小型模組，新增多種裝飾性方塊，包括：</p><ul><li>營火，將烈焰粉丟入火中（可配置觸發物品）</li><li>茅草，用剪刀剪開乾草捆產生的「流體」，可用鋤頭移除</li><li>木柵欄</li><li>木樑方塊，由 u/ksym_ 設計</li><li>火盆</li><li>吊燈，可反向合成（4 個火把）</li><li>碎石土，可反向合成（4 個泥土）</li><li>石柱</li><li>大鐵鍊，可攀爬</li><li>鐵柵欄門</li><li>格柵門</li><li>木座椅，右鍵坐下</li><li>木支架</li><li>營火、火盆與吊燈的靈魂火變種（1.16）</li></ul><ul><li>（1.18+）座椅與支架新增更多狀態，按住 Shift 點擊物品可查看提示。</li><li>（1.20+）使用物品標籤 #decorative_blocks:bonfire_activators 配置營火觸發物。</li><li>（1.20+）使用遊戲規則 decorative_blocks:disableThatch 停用茅草功能。</li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800000\">附加元件</span></strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p>冬季附加元件：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/decorative-winter\" rel=\"nofollow\">Decorative Winter<br></a>流體茅草支援與村莊：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thatched\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thatched</a>，為 Upgrade Aquatic、Bamboo blocks、Neapolitan、Environmental 方塊提供流體茅草變種（1.16.1 與 1.16.4）</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#800000\"><strong>模組支援</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp; &nbsp;主模組支援 Biomes O' Plenty（至 1.16 版）<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/decorative-blocks-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Decorative Blocks Compat</a> 支援 Biomes O'Plenty<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/decorative-blocks-modded-compat#c2\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Decorative Blocks Modded Compat</a>（由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/evo_934/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">evo-934</a> 製作的不同專案）：支援 Endergetic Expansion、Upgrade Aquatic、Autumnity、Environmental、Bayou Blues、Abundance（1.16.1 與 1.16.4）&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/every-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Every Compat (Wood Good)</a></p><p>鋸木台配方支援：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/woodcutter-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Woodcutter&nbsp;</a></p><p>農夫樂事支援：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-integration\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmers Delight Integration</a>（由 iku_tv 製作）</p><p>營火與火盆取暖效果：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/metabolism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Metabolism</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AofpqVI.gif\" alt=\"方塊展示\" width=\"900\" height=\"288\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2D6LewE.png\" alt=\"場景\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eL44pTi.png\" alt=\"場景二\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wkad8dDZEJQ?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
